  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Economic Opportunity (Microfinance), Beneficiaries: 58 members of Dufashabacu Cooperative (including 53 women) and their family members , Summary: The Project funds will be used to supplement the Cooperatives existing loan fund. Funds received will be issued by the Cooperative to eligible members who apply for these short-term, low-interest micro-loans from Dufashabacu to carry out their own income-generating activities.</narrative>
